{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FeltEmbeddedCare"}],"role":"article","title":"Felt Embedded Care iOS SDK","roleHeading":"Article"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Documentation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Felt offers a seamless telehealth experience inside health apps. Our platform handles the full user lifecycle, including onboarding, payments, and doctor visits, ensuring a cohesive healthcare experience.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Initialization","type":"heading","anchor":"Initialization","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At app launch, initialize the SDK with your SDK key using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/initialize(sdkKey:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". After that, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/shared","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for everything else. Accessing it before initialization is a programming error.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","anchor":"UIKit","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import FeltEmbeddedCare","","let feltSDKKey = \"...\"","","@main","class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","    func application(_ application: UIApplication, didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -> Bool {","        Task {","            do {","                try await EmbeddedCare.initialize(sdkKey: feltSDKKey)","                \/\/ Update any UI waiting on embedded care initialization","            } catch {","                \/\/ Error will be thrown for invalid key","            }","        }","        return true","    }","}"]},{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","anchor":"SwiftUI","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import FeltEmbeddedCare","","let feltSDKKey = \"...\"","","@main","struct ClientApp: App {","","    @State private var embeddedCareInitialized = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView(embeddedCareInitialized: embeddedCareInitialized)","                .task {","                    do {","                        try await EmbeddedCare.initialize(sdkKey: feltSDKKey)","                        embeddedCareInitialized = true","                    } catch {","                        \/\/ Error will be thrown for invalid key","                    }","                }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"User Account and Patient Details","type":"heading","anchor":"User-Account-and-Patient-Details","level":2},{"text":"Account","type":"heading","anchor":"Account","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once your app’s current user has been authenticated, provide their account details to the SDK using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/AuthManager\/account","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let user = ...","EmbeddedCare.shared.auth.account = Account(id: user.id, email: user.email)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the user logs out, inform the SDK by setting "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/AuthManager\/account"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["EmbeddedCare.shared.auth.account = nil"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Selected-Patient","type":"heading","text":"Selected Patient"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK considers the logged in person currently using your app to be a ","type":"text"},{"code":"patient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Your user’s account may be the same person or a distinct person from the actual patient using your app.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For example, the account holder may be a parent and the patient may be their child.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Even if the account holder and patient represent the same person, take care to distinguish their ids","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if your app’s data model keeps them distinct."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Account\/selectedPatient"},{"text":" property to provide patient details to the SDK for the currently logged in patient.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let currentFamilyMember = ...","EmbeddedCare.shared.auth.account?.selectedPatient = Patient(","    id: currentFamilyMember.id,","    relationshipToAccountHolder: .familyMember,","    email: currentFamilyMember.email,","    \/\/ Any custom information you want to provide","    custom: [\"notes\" : currentFamilyMember.notes]",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If any information changes about the account or the selected patient, just update ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/AuthManager\/account"},{"text":" with the latest information.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Component Experiences","anchor":"Component-Experiences","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to integrate Felt embedded care content alongside your app’s native content, use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ComponentView"},{"type":"text","text":", a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIView"},{"type":"text","text":" subclass, or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Component","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ComponentExperience"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum"},{"text":" for available options.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","anchor":"UIKit","level":3},{"code":["let componentView = ComponentView(experience: .dismissableCallToAction, custom: [:])","self.view.addSubview(componentView)","..."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"SwiftUI","anchor":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":3},{"code":["struct MyView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Component(experience: .dismissableCallToAction, custom: [:])","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component contents may be loaded asynchronously, which means a component’s layout can change over time. A component determines its intrinsic height based on its current width."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIKit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" components provide the ability to specify an ","type":"text"},{"code":"onHeightUpdated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" handler that allows you to react to intrinsic height changes. For example, you can use this handler to animate layout changes.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Full Screen Experiences","anchor":"Full-Screen-Experiences","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Felt provides several full screen experiences you can explicitly present. See the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenExperience","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"struct","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for available options, and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ExperiencePresentationManager"},{"type":"text","text":" for the presentation styles."}]},{"code":["EmbeddedCare.shared.experiences.presentExperience(.pricingScreen)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User interaction with components can automatically present full screen experiences."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alternately, you can explicitly present full screen experiences using "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"UIKit","anchor":"UIKit","type":"heading","level":3},{"code":["let viewController = FullScreenViewController(experience: .pricingScreen)","viewController.modalPresentationStyle = .fullScreen","self.present(viewController, animated: true, completion: nil)","..."],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"SwiftUI","anchor":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":3},{"code":["struct MyView: View {","","    @State var shouldPresentEmbeddedCare = false","","    var body: some View {","        MyViewContent($shouldPresentEmbeddedCare)","            .fullScreenCover(isPresented: $shouldPresentEmbeddedCare) {","                FullScreenView(experience: .pricingScreen)","            }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK will automatically modally present full screen experiences in response to user actions such as tapping a component."}]},{"text":"Feature Gating","anchor":"Feature-Gating","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can check if a feature is enabled for the current user by calling "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/checkFeatureGate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". See the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FeatureGate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum"},{"type":"text","text":" for available options."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, before displaying a component, you should call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/checkFeatureGate(_:)"},{"text":" with the relevant feature gate to make sure the component should be displayed.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if EmbeddedCare.shared.checkFeatureGate(.globalRollout) {","    \/\/ View logic to display `ComponentView`","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Deep Linking","anchor":"Deep-Linking","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK can handle certain deep-links to embedded care content through either urls or push notifications.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In your open-url and push notification handling code, call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/handleURL(_:)-swift.method"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/handleNotification(_:)"},{"text":" respectively to give the SDK an opportunity to respond to a deep-link event. Call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/processStoredDeeplinks()"},{"text":" once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the UI is in a stable state, so deep links that arrived earlier are handled.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Compatibility","anchor":"Compatibility","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK has minimum version requirements of Swift 5.5 and iOS 15.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/documentation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/documentation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare/documentation/FeltEmbeddedCare/FeatureGate":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FeatureGate","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enumeration of known features that can be checked for the current account"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FeatureGate","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/featuregate","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"FeatureGate","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FeatureGate","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare/documentation/FeltEmbeddedCa